        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The pachycephalosaurus damages a Medium or smaller (or a fucking dinosaur) foe with its skull Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The pachycephalosaurus digs in and flings its head up, shoving its foe away. It attempts an @Check[athletics|defense:fortitude] check against the target's Fortitude DC.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The pachycephalosaurus pushes the opponent up to 10 feet away from itself and knocks the target @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The pachycephalosaurus pushes the opponent back 5 feet.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The pachycephalosaurus fails to push the opponent.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the failed attempt leaves the pachycephalosaurus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for 1 round.</p>"
        },
